   "fieldtype": "Section Break",
   "label": "1. Setup"
  },
  {
   "description": "Export builds a bundle on this site. Import checks a bundle built on another site, then applies it. Copy puts one grain's setup onto another grain on this site. Check shows what a grain still needs before it goes live.",
